{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2502729","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【活动】2016八丈岛花绘皮卡丘","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"在八丈岛，约200人用20万朵花合力完成10米长的皮卡丘花绘，途中还经历了采花小插曲。","date":"2016-04-02","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 花のピカチュウ！","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 花のピカチュウ！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2502729.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160405004335id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2502729.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2502729/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/001-f242de8b26.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"在八丈岛，约200人用20万朵花合力完成10米长的皮卡丘花绘，途中还经历了采花小插曲。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<br>\n八丈岛举办的\n用鲜花描绘的画\n花毯画！\n    <br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/001-f242de8b26.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/001-f242de8b26.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好好看看！\n像这样铺满了密密麻麻的花朵！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/002-dbee7ce32a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/002-dbee7ce32a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n香味超级浓郁！\n            <br>\n \n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/003-8739d31f0c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/003-8739d31f0c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n皮卡丘也来加油助阵了！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/004-863f9ceacc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/004-863f9ceacc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/005-de6eca2966.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/005-de6eca2966.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n一起请它陪我拍了张照片！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后，作品一点一点做起来了！\n                <br>\n\n<br>\n \n大约50个人齐心协力，\n怀着“要做出可爱的皮卡丘”\n这样的想法，\n一只10米长的皮卡丘\n一点一点地完成了！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/006-7d4f9179fb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/006-7d4f9179fb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n然而……\n\n                这时发生了意外！\n                <br>\n\n<br>\n \n没想到！\n准备了整整10万枝的\n黄色小苍兰竟然用完了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                所以只好\n                紧急去摘花了……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n能看到八丈富士的地方，\n竟然有一片小苍兰花田！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/007-f1d31f3c9c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/007-f1d31f3c9c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n小心翼翼地摘下小苍兰！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/008-a2bf1deb0a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/008-a2bf1deb0a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n想到每一朵花\n最后都会变成皮卡丘，\n挑选花朵时也格外卖力！\n\n<br>\n摘花也很开心，\n\n                    意外也\n                    <br>\n很开心，变成了一段美好的时光！\n                    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n然后…… \n                    <br>\n\n<br>\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n补充了大量黄色小苍兰，\n开始最后冲刺！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/009-2d740d8ca7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/009-2d740d8ca7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n从开始之后经过了6个小时……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                        终于……\n                        <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n皮卡丘完成了！！！\n                        <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/010-5bab1cd339.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/010-5bab1cd339.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/011-08dc08185e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/011-08dc08185e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n怎么样？\n                                <br>\n\n<br>\n \n有很多事情\n一个人无法完成，\n但只要和许多人\n齐心协力、团结一心，\n就能完成更加了不起的事！\n就能完成更加精彩的事！\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n花毯画，\n真是一次美妙的体验！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n八丈岛的各位，\n皮卡丘粉丝的各位，\n花毯画的藤川先生，\n真的非常感谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n※听说最终参加人数一共200人，\n使用了20万朵花！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠）\n精力超级旺盛，\n                                <br>\n一转眼就跑到远处四处乱窜的\n皮卡丘！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/012-fd3453a4e6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/012-fd3453a4e6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>","markdown_ja":"<br>\n八丈島で行われた\n花で描く絵\nインフィオラータ！\n    <br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/001-f242de8b26.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/001-f242de8b26.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nよーく見てみて！\nこんな感じで花がびっしり！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/002-dbee7ce32a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/002-dbee7ce32a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nむちゃむちゃいい香り！\n            <br>\n \n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/003-8739d31f0c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/003-8739d31f0c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nピカチュウも応援にやってきた！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/004-863f9ceacc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/004-863f9ceacc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/005-de6eca2966.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/005-de6eca2966.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n一緒に写真撮ってもらった！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして、どんどん作られていく！\n                <br>\n\n<br>\n \n約50人が一つになって\n「かわいいピカチュウを作る」\nという思いで\n10mのピカチュウが\nどんどん作られていく！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/006-7d4f9179fb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/006-7d4f9179fb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\nしかし・・・\n\n                ここでアクシデント！\n                <br>\n\n<br>\n \nなんと！\n10万本も用意していた\n黄色のフリージアがなくなった！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                というわけで\n急遽 花摘みに・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈富士の見える場所に\nフリージア畑が！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/007-f1d31f3c9c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/007-f1d31f3c9c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nフリージアを丁寧に摘んでいきます！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/008-a2bf1deb0a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/008-a2bf1deb0a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n一つ一つの花が\nピカチュウになると思うと\n花選びにも力が入ります！\n\n<br>\n花摘みも楽しく\n\n                    アクシンデントも\n                    <br>\n楽しい素敵な時間に！\n                    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\nそして・・・ \n                    <br>\n\n<br>\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大量の黄色のフリージアが追加されて\nラストスパート！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/009-2d740d8ca7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/009-2d740d8ca7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nスタートしてから6時間・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                        ついに・・・\n                        <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n \n\n<br>\n\n\nピカチュウ完成しました！！！\n                        <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/010-5bab1cd339.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/010-5bab1cd339.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/011-08dc08185e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/011-08dc08185e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\nどうでしょう？\n                                <br>\n\n<br>\n \n一人でできないことも\n多くの人と\nチカラを合わせれば\nひとつになれば\nより凄いことが出来る！\nより素晴らしいことが出来る！\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\nインフィオラータ\n素晴らしい体験でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈島のみなさん\nピカチュウファンのみなさん\nインフィオラータの藤川さん\n本当にありがとうございました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n※最終的に参加総人数200名\n花は20万本使用だそうです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\nむっちゃ元気で\n                                <br>\n一瞬にして遠くまで走り回る\nピカチュウ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/012-fd3453a4e6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2502729/012-fd3453a4e6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>"}}